      "source": "Encapsulates the aggregation framework <code>$bucket</code>-operation. <br/>\nBucket stage is typically used with <a href=\"Aggregation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Aggregation</code></a> and <code>$facet</code>. Categorizes incoming documents into\ngroups, called buckets, based on a specified expression and bucket boundaries. <br/>\nWe recommend to use the static factory method <a href=\"Aggregation.html#bucket(java.lang.String)\"><code>Aggregation.bucket(String)</code></a> instead of creating instances of\nthis class directly.",
      "translation": "封装了聚合框架的 `$bucket` 操作。<br/>\nBucket 阶段通常与 <a href=\"Aggregation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Aggregation</code></a> 和 <code>$facet</code> 一起使用。它根据指定的表达式和桶边界，将传入的文档分类到称为“桶”的组中。<br/>\n我们建议使用静态工厂方法 <a href=\"Aggregation.html#bucket(java.lang.String)\"><code>Aggregation.bucket(String)</code></a> 来创建实例，而不是直接创建此类对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.ExpressionBucketOperationBuilderSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport.ExpressionBucketOperationBuilderSupport</code></a> implementation for <a href=\"BucketOperation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperation</code></a> using SpEL expression\nbased <a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.Output.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport.Output</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.ExpressionBucketOperationBuilderSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport.ExpressionBucketOperationBuilderSupport</code></a> 是用于基于 SpEL 表达式构建 <a href=\"BucketOperation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperation</code></a> 的 <a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.Output.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport.Output</code></a> 实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.OutputBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport.OutputBuilder</code></a> implementation for <a href=\"BucketOperation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.OutputBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport.OutputBuilder</code></a> 的实现，用于 <a href=\"BucketOperation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperation</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport</code></a> given fieldName to add an output field to the resulting\nbucket documents. <a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport</code></a> exposes accumulation operations that can be applied to\nfieldName.",
      "translation": "给定 fieldName 创建一个新的<a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport</code></a>，以便在生成的桶文档中添加一个输出字段。<a href=\"BucketOperationSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>BucketOperationSupport</code></a> 提供了可应用于 fieldName 的累积操作。",
      "count": 1
